{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues. The baby's name matches a novel narrator. Let me think about \"Zaphod\" (Hitchhiker's Guide narrator is actually the narrator, not Zaphod). Let me think about famous narrators: \"Holden\" (Catcher in the Rye), \"Nick\" (Great Gatsby), \"Scout\" (To Kill a Mockingbird), \"Huck\" (Huckleberry Finn), \"Ishmael\" (Moby Dick), \"Offred\" (Handmaid's Tale), \"Humbert\" (Lolita), \"Lolita\" (Lolita - though Humbert narrates), \"Zaphod\" (Hitchhiker's Guide). Let me search for celebrity babies born in 2021 with these names, and think about the hospital renaming clue more carefully.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"celebrity baby born 2021 named Zaphod second child\", \"celebrity baby born 2021 named Scout second child\", \"celebrity baby born 2021 named Huck second child\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_65a90cc1ed384781b0c48251","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"hospital renamed 2022 after celebrity baby born 2021\", \"Cedars Sinai hospital renamed 2022\", \"Lenox Hill hospital renamed 2022\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ed5b14d762094681abbefd55","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789382252,"id":"chatcmpl-94e1ad3f-602b-9fb4-8894-247c890d3614","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20335,"completion_tokens":272,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20607,"cached_tokens":15488,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":15488},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}